  "oracle_attribution": "The fixed test's zones/zone_isolation/zone_realloc cases call heapmem_zone_alloc/free/realloc with a heapmem_zone_t* and use HEAPMEM_ZONE_DEFINE to declare static per-zone buffers, plus heapmem_zone_stats. At base the API is heapmem_zone_register with a uint8_t heapmem_zone_t and footprint/max_footprint stats; heapmem_zone_free, heapmem_zone_realloc and HEAPMEM_ZONE_DEFINE do not exist, so the before snapshot is source_blocked and cannot compile. These symbols are the PR's stated purpose (isolated buffers per zone), not an incidental fixture, so the compile break is attributable to the fix.",
